  <h1>Air Conditioning Advice for Tockwith</h1>
  <p>Same engineers, same standards as our boiler work — the village out towards Wetherby, west of York. Here's what Tockwith homeowners and small businesses ask us most about air conditioning.</p>

  <h2>Home air conditioning in Tockwith</h2>
  <p>For a single room — a bedroom, home office, or loft conversion — a single-split system is usually the answer: one outdoor unit, one indoor unit. We size it for the room on a free home visit, not the biggest unit we can sell you.</p>
  <p>See our <a href="/air-conditioning-domestic-tockwith/">Domestic Air Conditioning in Tockwith</a> page for more.</p>

  <h2>Single vs multi-split — which do you need?</h2>
  <p>If you want to cool more than one room, a multi-split system runs several indoor units off one outdoor unit, so you're not cluttering the outside of the building with separate units for every room. It's a common choice for larger Tockwith homes and for small premises with more than one space to cool.</p>
  <p>See our <a href="/air-conditioning-split-systems-tockwith/">Single &amp; Multi-Split Air Conditioning</a> page for the full breakdown.</p>

  <h2>Air conditioning for Tockwith small businesses</h2>
  <p>Shops, offices and small units get the same standard of install as homes — proper sizing, proper commissioning, and we'll work around your trading hours where we can. A service contract keeps things running reliably through the warmer months, rather than finding out a unit's failed on the hottest day of the year.</p>
  <p>See our <a href="/air-conditioning-commercial-tockwith/">Air Conditioning for Small Businesses in Tockwith</a> page.</p>

  <h2>Brands and standards</h2>
  <p>We fit Bosch, Daikin and Haier systems, and we're F-Gas registered — the certification that covers safe handling of refrigerant, separate from Gas Safe (which covers gas appliances like boilers). For security reasons we don't publish the F-Gas number online, but we're happy to provide it directly on request.</p>

  <h2>Book a Tockwith visit</h2>
  <p>Whether it's a single room, a whole home, or a shop full of customers who'd rather not swelter, we cover Tockwith every week. Call us and tell us what you're cooling — we'll give you a straight answer, not a sales pitch.</p>
